{"id":276110725,"title":"255. DDL语句-表单的创建-DML语句-基本查询","summary":"数据库-DDL语句对表的常见操作（掌握）我们一般创建的话，会加上这个","content":"<p>数据库-DDL语句对表的常见操作（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783329620297-600e2366-9329-468b-ac75-12dc00159c97.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783329646854-e70b360c-5790-4e13-a5ab-a88dd89dbeff.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783329848416-cfa06fa5-2e3f-4c2d-b700-220ab568a54c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们一般创建的话，会加上这个<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783329932062-7e2cf456-03bf-4364-82e7-03e388021d61.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>3结束后我们再运行1的就可以查看到他新建的了。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783329882325-5f3b79c5-3f56-40eb-8f13-fbe8baacc762.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-创建的常见数据类型解析（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783330393992-8dc153e5-bbb7-44a8-982d-3c0df5c5b217.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783330447436-eba8a761-1f09-4323-a63a-ae107ccd58a7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们一般用的比较多的是TIMESTAMP<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783330572170-4d2b67ce-6421-4c92-aa65-2bc51f95e3cb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783330793552-4c50cd73-834f-48ba-979c-e11866c5f793.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-创建表时添加的表约束（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783331515173-9baf6890-59cd-4e1a-b940-fc7df764ed96.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>  <img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783331564035-7439a677-8f7d-4bbc-b75c-d873750d3396.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783405306866-b7274c04-1abe-4596-97a6-df3b4d254733.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-创建完整表结构和修改表结构（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p>我们先删除这个表<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783405340674-1e09aae2-47c5-42cd-ab75-f87a1f080e6f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>意思是要把id作为我们的主键，并且他还会自动增长。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783405452671-0f1c74f2-43f2-4ff5-ae70-16057e6199b4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>default是默认什么的，这里是默认等级是后面的数字。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783405647561-a86bc8ad-b7ac-4105-9ac5-057d1836c815.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>出现了一个空的一个表，我们可以手动的添加内容<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783405673395-505f878a-baa6-4b42-b2d6-d3b595e3d4d3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783405734098-05450088-dbcf-48f0-ba28-3a10349ded83.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们添加新的字段<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783405890315-77f69cd6-747f-433e-b21c-053cfc0ffa2b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783405870147-8dad192b-2e38-4b27-bf1f-9654ecbd6737.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783405964903-18320169-d5e5-4d86-8bf4-c772fcbf3f32.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们在前面多加一个列。然后删除。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783406000102-75216679-67bb-4f15-a100-9d2f8e1cb078.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783406009420-c89b4682-955c-4921-b56e-8caca97d8be3.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783406067447-111344c8-8cc5-41bb-a026-57185ee38e15.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783406085395-3b6ed48d-0f42-4952-bc7a-84acde472ae4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783406099094-e3ab96a1-7b95-4852-9510-9903a0fabdc1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-DML-在表中插入数据（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783406242750-571a9d6c-41d5-403d-8a03-de14a5cc488c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783406353001-0e99b006-7b99-470c-8435-8194011fbebe.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783406361978-70c76c9d-8b26-4e1e-80cf-d08063132e7a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783406452606-43090c6e-f87b-4365-9a23-d2098ded0bfb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783406517886-c8ae6fc7-73fe-49a9-8d3a-7bc111181bad.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783406574966-e8d534d3-261b-4070-9d30-f36c6d17be6e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783406582777-da6a3452-ac42-4632-97ed-b360e5a2ffb6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-DML语句查询-数据的删除和修改操作（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783406892177-ecf31aa5-a084-4dfd-b207-0e2655313fbc.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783406927892-20f7e9e3-785e-4091-8344-f883b7184f41.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783406985808-8c92c116-bdc1-4c13-9df8-aa6f09ee52c6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783407076912-168a7d70-c349-4b36-9f95-32a36767d8e0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783407086738-ee2ec6ef-6c7a-4efd-bd05-f8d3668e302b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-DQL语句-创建表和数据准备工作（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783407290402-e7184b75-16b2-40ed-826d-4bdd997f27d2.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783407302934-ee254305-b41e-4cea-a59b-d45bbd068268.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783407368523-bda605d6-d6f0-412e-90f3-8f464b9d6012.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783408703771-5eb3d3e0-2fb5-489d-85da-b8d5d2ee9d3b.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>进入到这个文件里面<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783408793134-6ce0c674-181c-46a3-940f-c59ed7801f1d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783408826245-1583a927-6c44-437c-88c5-46ab9ce96a19.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783408835603-110b8a81-3368-415c-b9d0-32cc005ca155.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783408852107-cc77f67b-0d0d-423c-acee-fb28a6bb4b2a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>老师自己准备的数据<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783408879464-a29bd004-5872-4b68-8027-0ebd75b5b6c4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-DQL语句-基本查询规则（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783408949836-4da1c935-874a-4e5a-be95-100cf27ec690.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783408961402-1d4d34f1-9cf9-4d5e-b638-5eecf8b55f42.png\" alt=\"\"><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783408971477-5c745647-655d-4468-89d6-eb6070d7e944.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>打开数据库之后已经有数据了。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783409002033-15dbf761-d244-4162-9fa7-b96a112adf47.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>AS关键字可以省略！</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783409363244-7b6b7faa-112e-4cf7-9190-38b2f2aa02df.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783409404812-9a4c7644-77bf-485d-8f90-9d1badb28c56.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-DQL语句-查询where条件（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783409649594-7cff81c5-5fcb-4956-a8fe-953d3a828447.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783411402287-4764cca4-dedc-45eb-ab0a-066e9fc20238.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783411444821-05a05266-4a63-4905-be69-018c4b07a36f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783411461611-bf70747f-898e-4c0e-ad8e-18bd601eb460.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783411477444-d1c75df9-9cb3-494d-a44d-97a03d2ec43e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783411497172-c1a66e30-7997-4757-92e6-b0e153b0b519.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783411594102-cdb95548-4dbf-4bf1-82cd-9eed0c08bf1f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783411650006-9c333b6e-c4bb-4401-9518-2283c4514480.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783411862397-8b8698af-1e85-4828-8139-efc9584f6bf4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783411849217-1ebc6caa-4f40-4c04-8af5-8aa3a7d5fca7.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-DQL语句-对表结果进行排序（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783412068404-fb48fc57-7e6d-4bbb-b578-59bf4bcfc1e4.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783411985438-b01ea046-4449-49e3-b654-ffbd98387780.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783412000501-83f6de9a-c645-4000-b1ae-6011b9ced96c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-DQL语句-对表进行分页查询（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>）</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783412251719-61e34278-3f9a-428a-a28e-3d4ae35036bb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>6.2：偏移40条数据，从41开始，要20条。6.3也是一样的意思，作用</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783412238282-9791b184-d740-4dd4-9038-3aa6b3154230.png\" alt=\"\"> </p>\n","contentFormat":"markdown","source":"yuque","cover":"","category_id":80707835,"category":{"id":80707835,"name":"nodejs","description":""},"created_at":"2026-07-02T06:22:43.000Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T08:20:41.000Z","view_count":0,"like_count":0,"is_top":0,"is_featured":0,"tags":[],"status":"published","yuqueUrl":"https://www.yuque.com/woyaoyizhishuidajue/hkk7kv/te9ikp8sx6logitq","slug":"te9ikp8sx6logitq","wordCount":424}